<title>PAKISTAN: Port conditions update - Pakistan - Lloyds Shippin.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - Pakistan - Lloyds Shippin.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>PAKISTAN, Feb 27 - Karachi, Feb 27 -- 12 Vessels waiting off port, including one container vessel, waiting one day, nine fertiliser vessels, first for 20 days, and two oil tankers, first for two days.</p>
